{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X在S08、S11、S12等短停留段的信息仍偏密集，即使感受分时出现，观众也可能来不及消化；Y的简洁叙述更容易快速扫完。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X的核心优势是重点突出、情绪有层次，而且音乐细节与人物心理变化之间建立了更具体的对应关系。尤其是从怀念、委屈、孤独、反复犹疑到逐渐接受的过程，X不仅讲清楚了人物在想什么，也让人感受到这些想法如何随着音乐发生变化。Y读起来更轻松流畅，但右侧短词有时像情绪标签的集合，缺少X那种随音乐推进而逐步展开的细腻感。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "06889bab-559c-4cd1-afbf-4bde18378b8d", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T022254481896Z", "elapsed_seconds": 76.515, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T02:24:11.019529+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "142b69a06ad5cff6dac6a041d237c5ccefc171802ef02c440af9c0c4a6d7c7ca", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "